# This machine's global gitignore excludes `.github`; re-include the CI workflow
# here so it stays visible to git (a repo .gitignore outranks the user-level
# excludes file). Without these three lines the workflow silently never ships.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/gate.yml
